        },
        {
            "title": "科技｜OpenAI縮減融資目標 估值降至1.25萬億美元",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"科技｜OpenAI縮減融資目標 估值降至1.25萬億美元\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e6cd3d35aab14a9b84d896addee28a7e5bc9c3f7f11e8c3427e591e579b8360d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">科技｜OpenAI縮減融資目標 估值降至1.25萬億美元</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">OpenAI已把本輪融資目標下調100億美元，現計劃以1.25萬億美元估值籌集約200億美元，較上月擬以1.4萬億美元估值融資300億美元為少。據報部分投資者已減少投資承諾。人工智能相關股票近期遭拋售，加上競爭對手Anthropic PBC正籌備上市、估值至少1.5萬億美元，令OpenAI爭取資金更形複雜。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT YouTube channel:<br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2FgJTen;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2FgJTen</a></p></div>",
